      "seed": 601614686,
      "version": 675,
      "versionNonce": 1170332062,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783058680991,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n- User should be able to create posts.\n- User should be able to friend/follow people\n- User should be able to view feed of post from people they follow.\n- User should be able to page through the feed.\n\nOut of Scope:\n- Post can be private or have restricted visibility.\n\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n- Highly availaible >> consistency\n- Posting and Viewing should be fast (< 500ms)\n- User should be able to follow unlimited number of users and followed by unlimited no\n of users.\n- System should handle massive number of users.",
      "fontSize": 32.525341931934676,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n- User should be able to create posts.\n- User should be able to friend/follow people\n- User should be able to view feed of post from people they follow.\n- User should be able to page through the feed.\n\nOut of Scope:\n- Post can be private or have restricted visibility.\n\n\nNon Functional Requirements\n- Highly availaible >> consistency\n- Posting and Viewing should be fast (< 500ms)\n- User should be able to follow unlimited number of users and followed by unlimited no\n of users.\n- System should handle massive number of users.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
