    },
    {
      "id": "1BoSmS252P1tilvL2_zDP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2244.831359394165,
      "y": 5903.306550344396,
      "width": 1213.45166015625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1569635970,
      "version": 29,
      "versionNonce": 489983746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783081831118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) How do we handle users who are following a large number of users?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) How do we handle users who are following a large number of users?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MZe7L2o6L3Wq7lyL0divg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2306.8622795724154,
      "y": 5967.200925234455,
      "width": 1688.471435546875,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 749792706,
      "version": 13,
      "versionNonce": 1519950530,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783083799679,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We'll be making a large number of queries to the Post table to build the feed. \n- This is called fan-out on read — a single read request fans out to create many more requests",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We'll be making a large number of queries to the Post table to build the feed. \n- This is called fan-out on read — a single read request fans out to create many more requests",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qiGAo6Iu8NdSyrjdmVXqj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2307.3731134348213,
      "y": 6071.129180529316,
      "width": 2013.1556396484375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1597311966,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1271676254,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783084382923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- we can compute the feed results on write or post creation rather than at the time we want to read their feed. \n- This is called fan-out on write — instead of assembling the feed when a user asks for it, \n   we precompute feeds when posts are created.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- we can compute the feed results on write or post creation rather than at the time we want to read their feed. \n- This is called fan-out on write — instead of assembling the feed when a user asks for it, \n   we precompute feeds when posts are created.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XQMQ5ciCuXqAHlqHnW-2n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2298.3750433382124,
      "y": 6257.524394861536,
      "width": 2165.839464784237,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 820547934,
      "version": 184,
      "versionNonce": 1522239966,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783084384492,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For users following a large number of users we can keep a PrecomputedFeed table. Instead of querying the Follow and\nPost tables, we'll be able to pull from this precomputed table. Then, when a new post is created, we'll simply add to the\nrelevant feeds.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For users following a large number of users we can keep a PrecomputedFeed table. Instead of querying the Follow and Post tables, we'll be able to pull from this precomputed table. Then, when a new post is created, we'll simply add to the relevant feeds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
