      "seed": 9238622,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 871522498,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783092088120,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) How can we handle uneven reads of Posts?\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) How can we handle uneven reads of Posts?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1d7VwId7B-zAQtFedKuQD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2365.6785570837474,
      "y": 12255.958588939646,
      "width": 1735.7396240234375,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 394674178,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 799549762,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783095978087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-  Each instance can service the same postID, which means a viral post's read traffic gets spread \n   across all N instances instead of hammering a single shard.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-  Each instance can service the same postID, which means a viral post's read traffic gets spread \n   across all N instances instead of hammering a single shard.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jLti5XDy7b-GXnCxIFNP7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2372.2865204100704,
      "y": 12368.899592887703,
      "width": 1566.03564453125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1751595330,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 150200898,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783095969939,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Since posts are very rarely edited, we can keep a long time to live (TTL) on the posts \n  and have our cache evict posts that are least recently used (LRU)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Since posts are very rarely edited, we can keep a long time to live (TTL) on the posts \n  and have our cache evict posts that are least recently used (LRU)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rlcAws-N0WjxXmR7pHYIk",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 3652.4573746565206,
      "y": 11078.448449638468,
      "width": 95.44312880006646,
      "height": 262.5053934552816,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
